flowchart TD
  Start([POST /api/v1/runs]) --> Init[initialized]
  Init --> Intake[intake<br/>load documents]
  Intake --> Guard[intake_guardrails<br/>IntakeGuardrailsAgent]
  Guard -->|rejected| Partial[completed partial]
  Guard --> Index[intake_indexing<br/>build_intake_index]

  Index --> URLGate{target_url<br/>in intake?}
  URLGate -->|no| Pause[awaiting_target_url<br/>checkpoint saved]
  Pause -.->|runtime-hints resume| Interpret
  URLGate -->|yes| Interpret[intake_interpretation<br/>normalize_intake_documents]

  Interpret --> Client{interpreted_intake?}
  Client -->|yes| CII[client_intake_interpretation<br/>QaObligationExtractor]
  CII --> Assets[test_asset_resolution<br/>TestAssetResolver]
  Client -->|no| Ready
  Assets --> Ready[readiness<br/>ReadinessAgent]

  Ready -->|block_run| Partial
  Ready --> Req[requirements<br/>RequirementsAnalyst]
  Req --> Cov[coverage]
  Cov --> TD[test_design]
  TD --> Tr[traceability]
  Tr --> Risk[risk_assessment]
  Risk --> Know[knowledge_retrieval]

  Know --> Mode{mode?}
  Mode -->|phase1| Rpt1[executive_reporting]
  Rpt1 --> Done[completed]

  Mode -->|full| PWArch[playwright_architect]
  PWArch --> PWGen[playwright_generator]
  PWGen --> Loop{execution loop}

  Loop --> Exec[execution<br/>npx playwright test]
  Exec -->|failures| RCA[failure_rca]
  RCA --> Heal[self_healing]
  Heal -->|healed| ReExec[reexecution]
  ReExec --> Exec
  Exec -->|max attempts or pass| Defect[defect_detection]
  Defect --> Excel[excel_deliverable]
  Excel --> Evid[collect_and_persist_evidence]
  Evid --> Rpt2[executive_reporting]
  Rpt2 --> Done

  Exec -->|fatal| Failed[failed]
